      style 56 fill:#e2e3fb,stroke:#343ced,color:#272834
      57["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Human Review System</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Container: Python, openpyxl]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Review service behind the Web<br />UI: builds the review queue<br />within reviewer capacity,<br />validates and records<br />approvals, edits and<br />adjudications, runs blind<br />labelling for the test set,<br />and closes cases. An Excel<br />review workbook remains as an<br />offline fallback.</div>"]
